### 4. Backend — Fix Cancel Scope

#### [MODIFY] [hardware-request-command.service.ts](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/backend/src/modules/hardware-request/services/hardware-request-command.service.ts)

**Problem:** `cancel()` (line 209-244) hanya izinkan dari SUBMITTED. State machine izinkan cancel dari AWAITING_DELIVERY & INSTALLATION juga.

**Fix:** Expand cancellable statuses:

```diff
-if (existing.status !== RequestStatus.SUBMITTED) {
-    throw new InvalidStateTransitionError(existing.status, RequestStatus.CANCELLED);
-}
+const CANCELLABLE = [
+    RequestStatus.SUBMITTED,
+    RequestStatus.AWAITING_DELIVERY,
+    RequestStatus.INSTALLATION,
+];
+if (!CANCELLABLE.includes(existing.status)) {
+    throw new InvalidStateTransitionError(existing.status, RequestStatus.CANCELLED);
+}
```

Juga perlu tambah permission check — ICT_STAFF bisa cancel dari status lanjut, USER hanya dari SUBMITTED:

```diff
+// USER can only cancel SUBMITTED requests they own
+// ICT_STAFF can cancel from SUBMITTED, AWAITING_DELIVERY, INSTALLATION
```

> [!WARNING]
> Cancel dari AWAITING_DELIVERY / INSTALLATION = hanya ICT_STAFF yang boleh. Bukan user biasa. Perlu `actorRole` parameter tambahan di `cancel()`.

